、TikTok、Amazon Prime Music、Anghami 以及全球数十个主流流媒体平台。此外，您可保留 100% 的权利和收益。通过社交链接分享您的最新作品。","tags":["音乐","音频"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://www.avid.com/","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/a/Avid/AvidLink/26.4.0.4668/Avid.AvidLink.yaml","sha256":"e9de2f1e39888257becc1f316f065046b2eb20145af3e8b3048487a0bab0421a"},{"path":"manifests/a/Avid/AvidLink/26.4.0.4668/Avid.AvidLink.installer.yaml","sha256":"30b1c2af43d215067e5cae834ea291235c51e29cd478ada9fa75a2293c648538"},{"path":"manifests/a/Avid/AvidLink/26.4.0.4668/Avid.AvidLink.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"7d7b28100a07f923a3465b55c7031a95e862092315902b15f7f21e298d9b3c02"},{"path":"manifests/a/Avid/AvidLink/26.4.0.4668/Avid.AvidLink.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"2ce02a87c1f282e9693cb751719c91f6707ab90bbcffbd49a19aa2ab2026e598"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"26.4.0.4668"}